docs/evidence/clean-runtime/** -text whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,-space-before-tab
docs/evidence/intermittent-failures/** -text whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,-space-before-tab
docs/evidence/pre-distribution-release/** -text whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,-space-before-tab
